care but hardly changed intermediate outcomes. In the short term, local adaptation of shared care guidelines does not   
improve the cardiovascular risks of people with type 2 diabetes."},                                                     
        {"study_index": 2, "title": "A telephone-delivered intervention for patients with NIDDM. Effect on coronary risk
