=== Study 106: A patient-centric, provider-assisted diabetes telehealth self-management intervention for urban 
minorities ===
Abstract: This article describes the design and implementation of an online diabetes self-management intervention for a 
sample of inner-city African Americans with diabetes. Study participants were randomly assigned to the treatment (26) 
and control (21) conditions. The results indicate that treatment group participants were more likely to achieve positive
outcomes in terms of lowered hemoglobin A1c and body mass index measurements than were control group members. These 
findings support the development of telehealth interventions to promote effective chronic disease management in 
medically underserved communities.


