care for Type 2 diabetes - The Asker and Baerum Cardiovascular Diabetes Study, a randomized trial', 'abstract': 'AIMS   
Few studies have compared structured vs. standard care on the effects of modifying several cardiovascular (CV) risk     
factors in subjects with Type 2 diabetes. Because of the complexity of the disease, we hypothesized that structured care
with a multi-interventional approach is necessary to effectively reach treatment goals and to reduce CV risk. METHODS An
